bas-c (1.1.5) stable; urgency=medium

  * RPM: apply packaging/rpm/*.patch via PatchN + %autosetup (bash.pc).
  * CI build-rpm: copy RPM-only patches to SOURCES; drop container .pc
    alias.
  * CI matrix: debian +i386/armhf/ppc64el/s390x; ubuntu amd64v3 (no
    ubuntu i386 — no Docker Hub image).
  * CI: drop cygwin; add win32 UCRT native builds (x64 + arm64).
  * CI: mingw NuGet id uses .gnu suffix; publish to reponupkg_forgejo.
  * CI: generate WinGet/Scoop (-gnu) + combined Choco manifests.
  * CI publish-private: REPORPM :1993; REPONUPKG :2080 (not git :1544).
  * CI build-deb: bullseye via snapshot.debian.org; loong64→sid;
    amd64v3 rename; apt retry + meson pip on bullseye.
  * CI build-rpm: docker cleanup for root-owned STAGE; EL8 meson pip;
    stage Debian bash-builtins headers (Rocky has none).
  * CI matrix: arch-specific images; drop bullseye ppc64el/s390x;
    verify all zips on release.
  * CI: extract verify-release-assets.sh (fix workflow YAML).
  * meson: bash loadable optional when headers/pkg-config missing
    (Win/MinGW); prefer bash.pc then bash-builtins.
  * CI UCRT: strip Git usr/bin from PATH so MSVC link.exe wins.

